guarantee: I-4: RecordingController::notice expires the previous message first (same rule as notice_with)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/recording/mod.rs
added_by: test-writer
equivalent: expire only clears an elapsed message and show then overwrites `message` unconditionally before refresh, so no input tells the two apart
--- old
        self.expire(at);
        self.show(id, params, at);
        self.refresh();
--- new
        self.show(id, params, at);
        self.refresh();
--- end
